  "details": "I would like to propose a gang system that enables users to form and manage gangs within the game. The system would include the ability to:\n\nDefine opponents (\"opps\"): Allow users to designate other gangs or players as rivals.\n\nNotification system: Provide special \"opponent\" notifications when an opponent joins the same instance, enhancing situational awareness.\n\nEngagement mechanics: Introduce in-game mechanics (such as weapons spawning) where players can spawn weapons and engage in combat with opponents.",
